<title>USA: SyStemix says rejects Sandoz offer.</title>
<headline>SyStemix says rejects Sandoz offer.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyStemix Inc said on Monday that its independent directors have rejected an unsolicited offer by Sandoz Ltd to acquire, at $17 per share, the outstanding shares of SyStemix that Sandoz does not already own.</p>
<p>SyStemix said the directors said that their decision was based in part on the advice of Lehman Brothers that the offer is inadequate and not fair to the minority shareholders from a financial point of view.</p>
<p>They said they remain willing to discuss an acquisition by Sandoz at an &quot;appropriate&quot; price.</p>
</text>
